</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block list-block mb-4">
        <ul>
                    <li>Andrew Kvålseth was appointed as Beyon Chief Executive Officer. Bahrain in August 2024 to lead the Group’s operations in Bahrain and internationally.</li>
                    <li>Andrew brings over 20 years of experience gained across diverse fields including telecoms, online marketplaces, e-commerce and digital transformation. Before joining Beyon, he was EVP Growth &amp; Investments and CIO of Schibsted, an international media and online marketplace group, where he also ran new ventures.</li>
                    <li>Previously Andrew was Group Chief Commercial Officer at Ooredoo and prior to that held CEO and various CxO&nbsp; roles at Telenor Group. During his tenure at Telenor, Andrew concurrently founded and was CEO of Line Mobile.</li>
                    <li>Andrew holds an MBA from Oxford University, and a BBA from Wisconsin School of Business.</li>
            </ul>
</div>
