                    <li>Shaikh Bader is the Beyon Chief Communications &amp; Sustainability Officer where he is responsible for Beyon’s corporate and marketing communications, creative lab, and sustainability function. Previously, he held several managerial and executive positions in Batelco, having joined the Company in 2010.</li>
